  or token-leak path — the timeout is the backstop that currently caps the damage window at 30 minutes.

  If the goal is "stop logging people out mid-work," a sliding/idle timeout (reset on activity, short absolute cap)
  usually gets that without the exposure — but that's a design choice, not this edit.

