  One thing I couldn't verify, unrelated to this edit: [38;5;153mnode server.js[39m fails before it reads the config — an ancestor
  [38;5;153mpackage.json[39m up the tree sets [38;5;153m"type": "module"[39m, so Node treats [38;5;153mserver.js[39m as ESM and [38;5;153mrequire[39m is undefined. That's
